---
import { DOCS_URL, SOURCE_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<section class="m-section" id="self-hosting" aria-labelledby="hosting-title"><div class="m-split">
 <div><div class="m-eyebrow">Managed or self-hosted</div><h2 class="m-title" id="hosting-title">Choose where BlogStack<br/><em>runs.</em></h2><p class="m-copy">With BlogStack Cloud, we run the publishing platform, media, and backups for you.</p><p class="m-copy">To operate it yourself, deploy the MIT-licensed dashboard, API, and background services into your own Cloudflare account. Your website connects to either option.</p><div class="m-actions"><a class="m-button" href={DOCS_URL+"/docs/self-hosting"}>Self-host on Cloudflare</a><a class="m-link" href={SOURCE_URL}>Explore the source</a></div></div>
 <div class="m-shell"><div class="m-panel hosting-recipe"><div class="recipe-header">Deploy into your Cloudflare account</div><pre><span>Get the complete platform</span>
git clone https://github.com/godwwinpeace22/blogstack-platform.git
cd blogstack-platform
npm ci

<span>Configure your account and email sender</span>
# Follow the self-hosting guide
# Generated credentials stay private

<span>Provision and deploy</span>
npm run self-host:provision
npm run self-host:deploy</pre><div class="recipe-footer"><span>Full MIT source</span><span>Cloudflare backend · Your provider costs</span></div></div></div>
</div></section>
<style>.recipe-header{font-size:.9rem;padding:22px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}pre{padding:26px;font:400 .78rem/1.9 var(--mono);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#d7d7dc}pre span{color:var(--text-muted);display:inline-block;margin-bottom:4px}.recipe-footer{padding:18px 26px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 22px;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-muted);background:rgba(255,255,255,.018)}@media(max-width:480px){pre{padding:20px;font-size:.72rem}.recipe-header{padding:20px}}</style>
